<title>USA: N.Y. metal futures opening forecasts.</title>
<headline>N.Y. metal futures opening forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>New York metals futures were called to open by traders as follows:</p>
<p>COMEX June gold - unchanged to down $0.50 an ounce</p>
<p>COMEX May silver - unchanged to down 1.00 cent</p>
<p>NYMEX July platinum - unchanged to down $0.50</p>
<p>NYMEX June palladium - unchanged to up $0.50</p>
<p>COMEX May copper - flat to up 0.50 cent a lb</p>
<p>((--New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1640))</p>
</text>
